>Kids judo</h3><p>Falling safely, rolling, and the first throws.</p></a><a class=\"dj-slab\" href=\"{{p:classes}}\"><span class=\"kj\">大人</span><span class=\"age\">AGES 16+</span><h3>Adult all-ranks</h3><p>Fitness, kata and sparring. Complete beginners welcome.</p></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><span class=\"dj-k\">02 · Belt ranks</span><div class=\"dj-belt\"><div class=\"dj-ladder\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Belt ranks\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-i=\"0\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--w:70px;--bc:#f4f2ec\"></span><span class=\"nm\">White · 白帯<small>10th kyu</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i=\"1\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--w:100px;--bc:#f2c200\"></span><span class=\"nm\">Yellow · 黄帯<small>8th kyu</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i=\"2\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--w:130px;--bc:#e8791c\"></span><span class=\"nm\">Orange · 橙帯<small>7th kyu</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i=\"3\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--w:160px;--bc:#2f8f4a\"></span><span class=\"nm\">Green · 緑帯<small>5th kyu</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i=\"4\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--w:190px;--bc:#2a5cb8\"></span><span class=\"nm\">Blue · 青帯<small>3rd kyu</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i=\"5\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--w:220px;--bc:#6b4226\"></span><span class=\"nm\">Brown · 茶帯<small>1st kyu</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i=\"6\"><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--w:250px;--bc:#111111\"></span><span class=\"nm\">Black · 黒帯<small>1st dan</small></span></button></div><div class=\"dj-info\" id=\"dj-info\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"dj-two\"><div class=\"dj-ph\" style=\"min-height:380px\" data-l=\"Sens