\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Dojo etiquette</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head)\">礼法</h1><p class=\"lead\">Six small rules that make the room feel the way it does.</p></div></section><section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><ol class=\"dj-rules\"><li><div><b>Bow at the door</b>Stop, bow toward the shomen, then enter.</div></li><li><div><b>Be early</b>Ten minutes before class, changed and warmed up.</div></li><li><div><b>Clean uniform, clean feet</b>Short nails, no jewellery, no shoes on the mat.</div></li><li><div><b>Listen first</b>When sensei speaks, kneel and listen.</div></li><li><div><b>Partner's safety</b>Control every technique. Tap early, tap often.</div></li><li><div><b>Leave it clean</b>Everyone wipes the mat at the end of class.</div></li></ol></section>","trial":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Free trial</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head)\">無料体験</h1><p class=\"lead\">One class, no obligation. Wear loose clothes and bring water.</p></div></section><section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"dj-two\" style=\"align-items:start\"><form class=\"form\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr\" onsubmit=\"return false\"><div class=\"fld\"><span>Name</span><input></div><div class=\"fld\"><span>Age</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"5\"></div><div class=\"fld span2\"><span>Class</span><select><option>Kids karate</option><option>Kids judo</option><option>Adult karate</option><option>Adult judo</option></select></div><div class=\"fld span2\"><span>Phone</span><input type=\"tel\"></div><div class=\"fld span2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dj-btn\">Book my class</button></div></form><div class=\"dj-info\" style=\"position:static\"><div class=\"big\">無料</div><h3>What to expect</h3><ul><li>45–60 minutes, with a sempai beside you</li><li>No uniform needed for the first class</li><li>Parents may watch from the bench</li></ul></div></div></section>","pricing":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Membership</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head)\">月謝</h1><p class=\"lead\">No joining fee. Cancel any month.</p></div></section><section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"dj-pr\"><div><span class=\"n\">子</span><h3 style=\"font:700 18px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.14em\">KIDS</h3><span class=\"p\">RM 120 / month</span><ul><li>2 classes a week</li><li>Belt tests included</li><li>Uniform RM 90 (once)</li></ul></div><div class=\"hl\"><span class=\"n\">大</span><h3 style=\"font:700 18px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.14em\">ADULT</h3><span class=\"p\">RM 160 / month</span><ul><li>Unlimited classes</li><li>Open mat access</li><li>Belt tests included</li></ul></div><div><span class=\"n\">家</span><h3 style=\"font:700 18px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.14em\">FAMILY</h3><span class=\"p\">RM 280 / month</span><ul><li>Up to 4 members</li><li>All classes</li><li>Seminar discounts</li></ul></div></div></section>","news":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>News & events</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head)\">お知らせ</h1></div></section><section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><a class=\"dj-news\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.11.02</time><h3>Belt grading, November</h3><span class=\"t\">Event</span></a><a class=\"dj-news\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.10.18</time><h3>Guest seminar: ground work with Sato Sensei</h3><span class=\"t\">Seminar</span></a><a class=\"dj-news\" href=\"#\"><time>2026.09.30</time><h3>Autumn term begins; new beginner block</h3><span class=\"t\">Notice</span></a></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head)\">よくある質問</h1></div></section><section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>I'm unfit and not flexible. Is that okay?</summary><p>That is who we teach. Nobody expects you to be anything yet.</p></details><details><summary>Is it safe for kids?</summary><p>Classes are small, strictly supervised, and we teach safe falling before anything else.</p></details><details><summary>Can I do both karate and judo?</summary><p>Yes. The adult plan covers all classes.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"dj-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(60px,10vw,140px)\"><span class=\"dj-k\">Error 404</span><h1 style=\"font:400 clamp(110px,22vw,300px)/.9 var(--f-head);color:var(--c-primary)\">一本</h1><h2 style=\"margin:10px 0 28px;font:700 22px var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.1em\">PAGE NOT FOUND — 技あり.</h2><a class=\"dj-btn\" href=\"{{p:home}}\">Back to the dojo</a></section>"}}